        "<div class=\"pads-reading\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;max-width:960px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;margin:12px auto 18px;padding:28px 32px;color:#36465a\"><h3 id=\"RNN-training-and-test-results\" style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:650;color:#16858a;margin:0 0 18px;\">RNN training and test results</h3><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 18px;color:#36465a;\">This model has its own optimizer, weighted cross-entropy and explicit training loop. Adam uses learning rate 0.001, weight decay 0.0001 and gradient clipping at 1.0. Maximum epochs are 40, with patience 8 after at least ten epochs.</p>\n",
